    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "この前のステップ、また見てもらいたいんすけど！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ、もちろんいいんだが\r\nちょっと今は先に話さなくちゃならないことがある",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "？　なんすか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』の一次審査、無事に通過したぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "一次審査……そうなんすね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　あまり嬉しくないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "嬉しい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん、どうなんすかね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……\r\nまぁ、わかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ところで、この前のステップの話だったよな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そっすよ！　プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700101/7017001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001010100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あれからわたしなりに色々試してみたんす！\r\nだから、見て欲しいっす",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
